  <text id="title" x="86" y="52" width="760" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">How the platform turns process into value</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="86" y="102" width="1060" height="56" font="body" size="20" color="muted" line-height="1.3"><p>Instead of treating approvals, evidence, land context, and supervision as separate problems, the platform connects them into one operating flow.</p></text>

